### 0. Get CSRF Token
GET http://localhost:8080/csrf
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
Accept: application/json

> {%
    client.global.set("csrfToken", response.body["token"]);
%}

###

### 1. GET All Cars
GET http://localhost:8080/cars
Authorization: Basic user user123
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. GET One Car
GET http://localhost:8080/cars/6ab9022ce0bb4abaad270d67
Authorization: Basic user user123
Accept: application/json

###


### 3. CREATE Car
POST http://localhost:8080/cars
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "brand": "Audi",
  "model": "A6",
  "year": 2025
}

> {%
    client.global.set("carId", response.body["id"]);
%}

###


### 4. UPDATE Car
PUT http://localhost:8080/cars/{{carId}}
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "brand": "Audi",
  "model": "A7",
  "year": 2026
}

###


### 5. DELETE Car
DELETE http://localhost:8080/cars/{{carId}}
Authorization: Basic superuser super123
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Accept: application/json

###
